  {
    id: "reactions",
    title: "Reactions",
    body: "Hand gestures trigger animated overlays: thumbs-up, heart, and more. Or fire them straight from the CLI.",
    icon: `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="24px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24px"><path d="M480-480Zm.13 360q-74.67 0-140.41-28.34-65.73-28.34-114.36-76.92-48.63-48.58-76.99-114.26Q120-405.19 120-479.87q0-74.67 28.35-140.41 28.35-65.73 76.95-114.36 48.6-48.63 114.3-76.99Q405.3-840 480-840q35.31 0 68.85 6.15 33.53 6.16 64.3 19.23 11.38 4.22 14.34 12.38 2.97 8.16.28 15.47-2.69 7.31-9.27 11.19-6.58 3.89-14.35.73-28.3-12.84-59.28-19Q513.9-800 480-800q-133 0-226.5 93.5T160-480q0 133 93.5 226.5T480-160q133 0 226.5-93.5T800-480q0-21.85-2.77-43.24-2.77-21.4-8.31-41.61-2.69-9 2.31-14.84 5-5.85 12.31-8.08 7.31-2.23 14.92 1.58 7.61 3.82 10.23 14.5 5.77 22.31 8.54 45.07Q840-503.85 840-480q0 74.7-28.34 140.4t-76.92 114.3q-48.58 48.6-114.26 76.95Q554.81-120 480.13-120ZM820-780h-60q-8.5 0-14.25-5.76T740-800.03q0-8.51 5.75-14.24T760-820h60v-60q0-8.5 5.76-14.25t14.27-5.75q8.51 0 14.24 5.75T860-880v60h60q8.5 0 14.25 5.76t5.75 14.27q0 8.51-5.75 14.24T920-780h-60v60q0 8.5-5.76 14.25T839.97-700q-8.51 0-14.24-5.75T820-720v-60ZM612.49-535.38q18.66 0 31.55-13.07 12.88-13.07 12.88-31.73 0-18.67-13.06-31.55-13.07-12.89-31.73-12.89-18.67 0-31.55 13.07-12.89 13.07-12.89 31.73 0 18.67 13.07 31.55 13.06 12.89 31.73 12.89Zm-264.62 0q18.67 0 31.55-13.07 12.89-13.07 12.89-31.73 0-18.67-13.07-31.55-13.06-12.89-31.73-12.89-18.66 0-31.55 13.07-12.88 13.07-12.88 31.73 0 18.67 13.06 31.55 13.07 12.89 31.73 12.89ZM480-284.62q49.71 0 91.7-23T640.49-370q5.36-9.85.28-19.92Q635.69-400 624-400H336q-11.69 0-16.77 10.08-5.08 10.07.28 19.92 26.8 39.38 69.22 62.38t91.27 23Z"/></svg>`,
